_mm_cmpneq_ps | sse | (a: __m128, b: __m128) -> __m128 | intr | cmpps $4, <b>, <d> | pure tied=a | none | - | r[k] = if a[k] != b[k] { -1 } else { 0 } (r: i32 lanes) | - | lanewise compare (predicate 4): a mask, each lane all ones or 0
